message: "If you use Diffusion Atlas in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Diffusion Atlas: reading the generative trajectory of a denoising model"
abstract: >-
  Diffusion Atlas reads the generative trajectory of a denoising model, the path through
  latent space that produces an image. Part of the Vector Lab family of research
  instruments. Built at Copenhagen Business School, Denmark, during an Otto Mønsted
  Visiting Professorship in 2026. The support of the Otto Mønsted Fond (grant
  25-12-1849) is gratefully acknowledged.
